IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0012.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY SHP0012C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 WS-SBLK            PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> DELIVERY SURCHARGE
    05 X-CG               PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM DANGEROUS-GOODS
    DISPLAY "WS-SBLK=" WS-SBLK
    DISPLAY "X-CG=" X-CG
    STOP RUN.
DANGEROUS-GOODS.
    IF TX-D-GI = 'Y'
        IF TX-WS-SVC = 'O'
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-SBLK
        *> LONG-DISTANCE HAZARDOUS SURCHARGE - LIMIT 250 PER 1998 POLICY
        ELSE IF TX-WS-DIST > 500
            MOVE 60 TO X-CG
        ELSE
            MOVE 25.00 TO X-CG
        END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
